 the  position that's Goodman lever kurzberg  and Holloway Law Firm because she's  given an ultimatum she'll have a job  with them but only if she agrees to take  on Blonsky as a client if she refuses  she'll be back on the job hunt since  Abomination tried to kill the Hulk Jen  has some feelings about representing  Blonsky even though she's already made  up her mind she calls Bruce to get his  Blessing and he tells her it's totally  fine turns out Blonsky took the step of  writing Bruce a letter and even a haiku  many years ago and the two men have  since put their violence past behind  them that fight was so many years ago  I'm a completely different person now  literally the joke is low hanging fruits  but it works in fact it works so well  because Marvel already used it once  remember the actor Switcheroo for James  Roadie Rhodes between Iron Man 1 and  Iron Man 2. Terence Howard portrayed  Tony Stark's best friend in the first  film next time baby but he never got us  next time instead Iron Man 2 saw Don  chidor take up the role how they  acknowledge the shift back in the day  look it's me I'm here to deal with it he  is hoping Edward Norton took the joke  better than Terry parents how it did  [Music]

